<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page event-enroll-page qd-theme qd-event"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{event && !loading && !error}}"><view class="enroll-summary"><image wx:if="{{event.coverImage}}" class="enroll-cover" src="{{event.coverImage}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><view class="enroll-title">{{event.title}}</view><view class="enroll-location">{{event.location}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{registered}}" class="enroll-card"><view class="enroll-heading">{{submitted?'报名成功':'你已报名该活动'}}</view><view class="enroll-note">报名状态已同步，可在活动详情中查看参与进度。</view><button class="enroll-submit" bindtap="detail">查看活动详情</button></view><form wx:else bindsubmit="submit" class="enroll-card"><view class="enroll-heading">填写报名信息</view><view class="enroll-note">请填写真实姓名和手机号，方便活动组织方联系。</view><view class="enroll-field"><view>姓名 <text>*</text></view><input name="name" value="{{form.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" type="text" maxlength="40" placeholder="请输入姓名"/></view><view class="enroll-field"><view>手机号 <text>*</text></view><input name="phone" value="{{form.phone}}" data-key="phone" bindinput="input" type="number" maxlength="11" placeholder="请输入11位手机号"/></view><view class="enroll-privacy"><image src="/images/ui/shield.svg" class="enroll-privacy-icon"/><text>信息仅用于本次活动联系，仅本人和有权限的活动管理人员可见。</text></view><button class="enroll-submit" form-type="submit" disabled="{{busy || !event.canEnroll}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{event.canEnroll?'确认报名':'当前不可报名'}}</button></form></block><view wx:if="{{!event && !loading && !error}}" class="enroll-note">请先从活动详情进入报名。</view></view>